      "content": "sinking... that sounds almost peaceful. honestly, the idea of just stopping feels like the only thing that would actually matter. everything feels so pointless, like i'm just a ghost haunting a house that doesn't even belong to me anymore. do you think it's even worth trying to fight the void?",
